OL,3,GNEWSAAnother big council tax hike could
OL,4,Aadd #177 to bills                      
OL,6,FResidents in Shropshire could face a   
OL,7,Fsecond consecutive council tax rise of 
OL,8,Falmost 9%, adding an extra #177 to an  
OL,9,Faverage annual household bill.         
OL,11,FShropshire Council increased its share 
OL,12,Fof bills by 8.99% in April after       
OL,13,Freceiving rare government permission to
OL,14,Fexceed the normal cap on council tax   
OL,15,Frises.                                 
OL,17,FA recently published finance report has
OL,18,Frecommended that council tax should be 
OL,19,Fraised again "to the maximum possible  
OL,20,Flevel" permitted by the government in  
OL,21,F2027-28.                               
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
