OL,3,GNEWSAAnother big council tax hike could
OL,4,Aadd #177 to bills                      
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat council leader Heather
OL,7,FKidd said no decision had yet been     
OL,8,Fmade, but admitted households could    
OL,9,Fface another 8.99% increase as the     
OL,10,Fauthority continued to battle severe   
OL,11,Ffinancial pressures.                   
